  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2907.04 Initial Certification and Recertification Procedures. The owner or operator of an affected source shall comply with the initial certification and recertification procedures of 40 CFR 75.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2910.04); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
